            "review_text": "KHÔI\nNha Trang, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nExcellent Service\nMar 2024 • Family\nI had the pleasure of dining at The Bistro - TPT Wine House recently, and I must say, it was a delightful experience from start to finish. The staff were incredibly friendly and kind, making me feel right at home as soon as I walked in. But it was the food that truly stole the show. Every dish was bursting with fantastic flavors and beautifully presented. I left feeling completely satisfied and already planning my next visit. If you’re looking for a restaurant with both amazing food and welcoming hospitality, I highly recommend this one.\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2024",
